        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQycWZLVlRnEAE!2m1!1s0x3404017e369bbfbd:0x375b1164112dd431"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJvb-bNn4BBDQRMdQtEWQRWzc/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURaX1lTcm1RRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 年前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "偶然在時代廣場旁邊見到The Matcha Tokyo，原來日本人氣抹茶店已經進駐香港，太耐冇去銅鑼灣了。本想重溫抹茶味道，見到有咖啡反而想試，買了杯大Latte，飲落應該是中烘焙，有種朱古力般的微苦味及醇厚咖啡風味，飲完感覺好爽，好飲！\n\n下次回來要試抹茶及雪糕😌",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "偶然在時代廣場旁邊見到The Matcha Tokyo，原來日本人氣抹茶店已經進駐香港，太耐冇去銅鑼灣了。本想重溫抹茶味道，見到有咖啡反而想試，買了杯大Latte，飲落應該是中烘焙，有種朱古力般的微苦味及醇厚咖啡風味，飲完感覺好爽，好飲！\n\n下次回來要試抹茶及雪糕😌",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Jason To",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100619914520091418138/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPkNQODRWSv8N_k6975SBchi5JQVIeO1hyq8eehOSMwVaXcuI1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6"
